note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Existing router u32 little-endian picks to ABI1 logical ulong words.
note n counts active entries, not tokens; no masking or expert validation here.
fn moe_ids32 src view uchar 4096 n ulong ids edit ulong 1024 to ulong
if gt n 1024
ret 1
end
for i ulong n
v = ulong 0
for b ulong 4
v = or v shl ulong get src add mul i 4 b mul b 8
end
put ids i v
end
ret 0
end
